{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Club Soko is a Sokoban style puzzle game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Club Soko, you must read the room by\u00a0outsmarting the visitors of each dancefloor using what you have around you. Each level is carefully crafted to teach you new, surprising and tricky ways of delving deeper and deeper into the depths of an exclusive nightclub. Secrets lurk in the depths of Club Soko.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/club_soko_steam_000.gif?t=1745244521\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play as Maude!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Maude, a graffiti artist set on spray painting her tag on every available inch of the nightclub walls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/club_soko_steam_005.gif?t=1745244521\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character is its own Sokoban esque puzzle piece with its own <strong>predictable behaviors</strong>\u00a0on a grid.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate your way through over <strong>100+\u00a0handcrafted levels</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An <strong>undo system</strong> to solve puzzles in your own time, work through ideas and undo your mistakes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore dancefloors</strong>\u00a0each featuring their own distinct 2.5DHD visual style and musical themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Classic Sokoban Reimagined</strong> - It wouldn't be a Sokoban without boxes! Use objects such as <strong>speakers, amps, and even other dancers\u00a0</strong>when making your way past bouncers isn't quite enough to get to the next dancefloor!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/club_soko_steam_002.gif?t=1745244521\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/club_soko_steam_001.gif?t=1745244521\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Venture into the underbelly of Club Soko...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/club_soko_steam_004.gif?t=1745244521\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3346410?t=1745244521","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745244521","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/0c92ab3e3a41a0d9338d6b1b448c566f75b3de0e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745244521","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/0c92ab3e3a41a0d9338d6b1b448c566f75b3de0e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745244521","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3507130,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Club Soko is a Sokoban style puzzle game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Club Soko, you must read the room by\u00a0outsmarting the visitors of each dancefloor using what you have around you. Each level is carefully crafted to teach you new, surprising and tricky ways of delving deeper and deeper into the depths of an exclusive nightclub. Secrets lurk in the depths of Club Soko.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/club_soko_steam_000.gif?t=1745244521\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag